MPRINT(TABDCAT):   *----------------------------------------;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   *** Total patient count variable, used for calculating cell percents ***;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   **********************************************************************;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   *** Recalculate the counts without the missings ***;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   *** if MISSPCT requested (print missings as a category) ***;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   *** and NOMISSPC requested (do not use missings in the denominator ***;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   **********************************************************************;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   ***************************************************************************;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   *** test: if n = 100 pct for any subgroup and then skip the calculation ***;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   *** for cilevelw ***;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   ***************************************************************************;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   ******************************************;
MPRINT(TABDCAT):   *** put together the display data set ***;
